---
title: "borrow_flash_loan_inner (flash_loan.move)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_circuit: market.has_circuit_break_triggered()
    q_check_circuit --> q_error: circuit_break == true
    q_check_circuit --> q_borrow: circuit_break == false
    q_error --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_borrow --> q_emit: (coin, flash_loan) = market.borrow_flash_loan(emode_group, amount, ctx)
    q_emit --> q_build_event: emit BorrowFlashLoanEvent
    q_build_event --> [*]: return (coin, flash_loan)

    note right of q_check_circuit
        INV-001: Circuit breaker is checked before any state mutation
        INV-002: assert! aborts transaction if circuit break is triggered
    end note

    note right of q_borrow
        INV-003: emode_group parameter controls which asset group to borrow from
        INV-004: market.borrow_flash_loan creates hot potato FlashLoan object
        INV-005: amount must not exceed available liquidity in pool
    end note

    note right of q_emit
        INV-006: Event fee = flash_loan.fee() (computed by market)
        INV-007: Event amount = input amount parameter, not coin.value()
    end note
